    "title": "Long Timers of Sarasota County to Meet at 'Friends Fest' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The Friends of the Sarasota County History Center will host Friends Fest 2025 on October 26 from 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. at the Sarasota Farm Bureau, 7289 Palmer Boulevard, to launch Long Timers of Sarasota County, a new group for residents who have lived in the county for 30 years or more. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
